{"name": "Koromi", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Koromi is a grappling-based 3D platformer where building and conserving momentum is key. Swing through blooming and poetic environments...at least most of the time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the mystery behind the recent appearance of an ominous red star by venturing in the forbidden jungle, where ancient spirits are said to dwell.\u00a0The Koromi tribes are counting on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras_big/3b2b9fae4c61f3fcb2bd93c3043f6720.avif?t=1784016776\" height=\"267\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/3b2b9fae4c61f3fcb2bd93c3043f6720.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/6ff6178fc2fce8874f417a8f0d3be249.poster.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/6ff6178fc2fce8874f417a8f0d3be249.webm?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/6ff6178fc2fce8874f417a8f0d3be249.mp4?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide the pace.\u00a0Chain together swings, sprints, and jumps to build speed or make precise, calculated moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras_big/7d113fb5fa5dec5e5674bb0731553472.avif?t=1784016776\" height=\"118\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/7d113fb5fa5dec5e5674bb0731553472.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/724029eb593965051bf69038bf855bbb.poster.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/724029eb593965051bf69038bf855bbb.webm?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/724029eb593965051bf69038bf855bbb.mp4?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run down a slope or jump from a great height to gain momentum quickly. Then use it to jump further, or swing higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras_big/c85bc02b992b3c3088c31bf012b07848.avif?t=1784016776\" height=\"179\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/c85bc02b992b3c3088c31bf012b07848.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/3d799e2981e78fbf479ca2525c2c2c50.poster.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/3d799e2981e78fbf479ca2525c2c2c50.webm?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/3d799e2981e78fbf479ca2525c2c2c50.mp4?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Release the hook at the right timing to determine your direction and speed. Overcome obstacles through your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras_big/48f26be2714e3c7b63129fef6711a32a.avif?t=1784016776\" height=\"141\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/48f26be2714e3c7b63129fef6711a32a.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"800\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/d552c4fa75fe4e4aae40316521734509.poster.avif?t=1784016776\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/d552c4fa75fe4e4aae40316521734509.webm?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/extras/d552c4fa75fe4e4aae40316521734509.mp4?t=1784016776\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together an ancient tale through environmental hints and conversations with cute but dead-serious characters.\u00a0Koromi is a journey of discovery, both of self and as a species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through misty forests, tranquil meadows, and ancient ruins hand-crafted to invite you to pause\u2014and then sprint again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist our game where Spider-Man meets Jusant and Journey!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Master your grappling hook and explore soothing natural landscapes. Venture into the forbidden jungle to discover the mystery behind your species' origin.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780770/18fdad4fc828323d39eaddd071338b8ad994cc2a/header.jpg?t=1784016776", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "3D Platformer", "Platformer", "3D", "Cute", "Third Person"], "developers": "Super Seeded", "publishers": "Super Seeded", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3780770", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 February 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IMI-zmenWaE", "first_seen": 1771455600.0, "review_rank": 1176}